"Access group %(group)s: %(door)s was not imported, so the right on it is "
"left out."
msgstr ""
"Група за достъп %(group)s: %(door)s не беше импортирана, затова правото за "
"нея е изключено."

#. module: hr_rfid_hardware_import
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_rfid_hardware_import/models/importer.py:0
msgid ""
"Access group %(group)s: the right on %(door)s follows schedule %(n)s, which "
"this company does not have, so the right is left out."
msgstr ""
"Група за достъп %(group)s: правото за %(door)s следва график %(n)s, който "
"тази фирма няма, затова правото се пропуска."

#. module: hr_rfid_hardware_import
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_rfid_hardware_import/models/analyser.py:0
